  "details": "Description\n\nFurality Luma sky is bright purple instead of night sky.  Occassionally it works normally, world has not been updated in a long time so not likely due to a recent change to the world itself.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nJust enter the world.  I've cleared the cache and reloaded the world and it does this 99 out of 100.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: World\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1919-27c41b24d2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-04_19-48-44.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_766aea3c-3fb0-4894-8963-663a172e840f/1/file)",
